    "html": "<p>Monochromatic light of frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span> is incident normally on a diffraction grating with a grating spacing <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span>. The angle that the second-order maximum makes with the straight-through position is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span>. When the frequency of the incident light and the grating spacing are both doubled, the angle that the <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n\"></span>th-order maximum makes with the straight through position is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span>. What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
